<title>USA: Marcus names Douglas Neis CFO.</title>
<headline>Marcus names Douglas Neis CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marcus Corp said it named Douglas Neis chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
<p>Neis replaces Kenneth MacKenzie, 62, who will remain with the company in a limited capacity as director of taxation, the company said.</p>
<p>Neis, 37, had been corporate controller of Marcus since 1995, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
